        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana S35R5HD, 3-1/2\" x 3-1/2\" x 5/8\" Radius Heavy Duty Durable Steel Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage includes a pair of hinges (2) with matching finish steel flathead, Phillips Drive #10 x 1\" wood screws. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFitted with a high grade, removable, steel pin. Utilizes template screw hole pattern for use with wood or metal doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<P>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-S35RHD-specifications.gif?v=1704354610\" width=\"558\" height=\"277\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana S35R5HD Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 3-1/2 Inch Heavy Duty Steel Door Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Durable Steel</li>\r\n<li>Height: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: 5/8\" Radius</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.119\" (Heavy Duty)</li>\r\n<li>Standard Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Pin: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #10 x 1\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-S35R5HD-specifications.pdf?v=1704262167\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana S35R5HD Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWe offer 8 different finishes for this Hinge, but no matter which finish you choose, the parts will still be <b>high quality durable steel</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold in Pairs (2 Hinges)</b>\r\n</p>",
